 he wants to  achieve his ideal of freedom so badly  and he believes that he can only achieve  it through his current plan  and so because of this in many ways  aaron is not free  he is not free to change his mind he is  not free to go back to the innocence of  his childhood  he is not free to reconcile with his  friends in some ways he has been  enslaved by his own  plan and his own convictions this is a  fascinating development when you think  about it  and i could spend literally hours  talking about aaron and freedom and the  different  often competing definitions of what  freedom is but  that might be a topic for another video  so for now let's move on when armin asks  aaron why he brought them here in the  first place  aaron explains that he wanted to tell  them that they cannot  change his mind or talk him out of the  rumbling the only way to stop aaron is  to end his life  and his comrades are free to do this if  that is their decision  and aaron wants them to know it now in  that moment  the allies find themselves back inside  the airplane  and they now know that bargaining with  aaron will not work  there will be no negotiating there will  be no debating there will be no trying  to talk him back to his senses  the rumbling will go all the way unless  they kill  aaron the chapter then switches focus to  the steamship where annie kiyomi gabby  and falco currently are  and it is on that ship that we arrive at  a massive  game-changing titan twist but we'll talk  about that in a little bit  annie thinks back to all the important  people in her life this includes her  father  her fellow warriors and of course her  comrades from the 104th training corps  finally she thinks of armin and all of  it breaks her heart  because it's too late it's too late for  liberio  it's too late for the survey core and  it's too late for her father  but in that moment of heartbreak and  desperation for annie  falco says something that seems kind of  random he says that he had  a dream however things change and  escalate really quickly  as we realize what kind of dream it was  and what it really means  falco says that this dream was not his  own  it was a dream or memory from zeke the  beast  titan since falco was turned into a  titan through  zeke's spinal fluid he seems to have  inherited some of the beast titan's  traits  along with some of zeke's memories  furthermore  according to gabby the female titan  seems to have a special ability that we  didn't really know  that much about and that ability is to  mimic  the power of another titan if she can  eat  a part of that titan first of all this  is crazy  and i will talk about it more later and  second of all  falco believes that if the female titan  has this ability  then perhaps his jaw titan can inherit  the abilities of the beast titan due to  his connection  to zeke's spinal fluid falco explains  that in this memory or dream that he has  been having  he can see himself flying above the  clouds  and falco feels deep within himself that  he can really do this  he can fly through the air with  his titan falco is convinced that  sometime in the past there had been a  winged  beast titan since falco's jaw titan has  clear bird-like features as i mentioned  in my previous videos  it is possible that falco's jaw titan  has inherited some of the traits  of this previous flying beast titan  this means that falco's jaw titan could  theoretically become  the first flying titan shifter that  we've ever  seen and if this is true it is not only  a massive twist  i mean fan speculations about a flying  titan have been rampant  ever since we first learned about the  titan shifters but this could also be a  major  game changer in my video on the previous  attack on titan chapter  i mentioned that i was surprised to see  annie taking herself  out of the final battle and effectively  benching herself  and the female titan after being stuck  in the crystal for so many years  it all seemed very anti-climactic from a  narrative perspective  why have annie break out of the crystal  after so many years  if she is just going to sit out the  final battle and bench  the female titan shifter if falco can  figure out how to make his titan fly  he can just take annie on his back and  fly her right  into the final battle if annie does  change her mind after all  and if falco's titan can fly then they  can both join the final battle later on  even though they didn't board that  airplane and this means that the final  battle will include  all nine titan shifters after all and i  mean this would only make sense from a  writing perspective  the final showdown in the final series  should include all the titan shifters  after this crazy revelation about  falco's titan  i am now convinced that falco and annie  will fly up to aaron  and join the final battle at some point  in the future  and that final battle will be absolutely  legendary the chapter then switches  focus yet again  this time to fort salta and the  surrounding area  we see a train heading towards the fort  and then we get  yet another big twist annie's dad  reiner's mom peaks dad and the families  of gabby and falco  are still alive in fact they seem to  have hijacked a train  and annie's dad is holding the train  conductor hostage at gunpoint  if you think back to chapter 125 we saw  annie's dad and the other aldians in  liberio  trying to explain to the marlene  soldiers that the rumbling  is coming the aldians had all received  aaron's message  through the paths but the merlions had  not and the soldiers refused to believe  what the aldians were saying in fact the  soldiers started beating the aldians  and it looked like there might be some  sort of alden rebellion happening within  liberia  but we never got to see what happened  with that potential rebellion  because the focus of the story shifted  to other things  it now seems that the rebellion did in  fact occur  and at least some of the ldns were able  to get out of the barrio using this  hijacked  train when we heard that all of the  barrier was already destroyed i kind of  assumed that all of these guys were in  fact dead  but this twist makes me think that  isayama might plan to have some sort of  happy  ish ending after all i mean if he just  wanted to kill off everyone he wouldn't  have gone through the trouble of having  all of these family members of the  warriors survive  so who knows maybe isama will show some  level of mercy to the remaining  characters  in the end the aldians on the train are  hoping to escape the rumbling by taking  control  of one of fort zalta's airships but as  the train approaches salta  an entire fleet of airships takes off  from the fort  in that moment the trained passengers  realized that the rumbling has  already caught up to them and all of  these airships are taking off  in a desperate attempt to fight back  against the rumbling  not only are the wall titans here but  aaron's gigantic titan  is here as well it looks like the fleet  of airships is about to bomb the wall  titans in an attempt to slow down the  rumbling  but even though i'm sure that the  airships possess some powerful  explosives i don't think anything short  of nukes will be able to stop the  rumbling  at this point however the fleet of  airships may slow down the rumbling long  enough for the passengers of the train  to get away so we'll have to wait and  see and that is how this  roller coaster of a chapter ends even  though we didn't get to see any crazy  titan fight  in this chapter we got so many twists  and turns  aaron summoning the allies through the  paths and explaining why they still have  their titan powers while at the same  time refusing to negotiate or  back down the reveal that the female  titan has the ability to mimic the power  of other shifters  if she consumes a portion of their  bodies then we got the huge twist that  falco's jaw titan may be capable of  flying  finally we learned that the families of  the warriors are actually alive  even though everyone had assumed that  they were dead wow  so much has happened in just a single  chapter of attack on titan i cover  multiple manga series on this channel as  you guys know  an attack on titan chapters rarely fail  to amaze me  this reveal about the female titan  changes everything that we thought we  knew about her  is her ability to harden parts of her  body a result of her consuming a part of  the  armored titan is her ability to call the  mindless titans to her  the result of consuming a part of the  beast titan  and are there other insane abilities  that she can yet  attain for example what happens if she  somehow consumes a portion of aaron's  gigantic titan there are so many  possibilities and this final showdown is  shaping up to be an absolute  scorcher and yes i am now convinced that  both annie and falco  will join the final fight and speaking  of falco  do you think that his titan really will  unlock the ability to fly  that is now the only way for all of the  titan shifters to participate in the  final battle  falco will have to fly himself and annie  right up to aaron  and i do believe that the story is  heading in that direction  do you guys agree and if you do what  will falco's flying titan's final form  look like  and what abilities will it have let me  know down below  finally does the survival of the  warriors families mean that isama might  choose a not so tragic ending after all  i mean there is already plenty of  tragedy to go around but does this twist  mean that isama is going to show mercy  to the characters who have survived  up to this point man i can't wait to see  what happens next  and as much as i don't want this series  to end i also can't wait to see  how it ends if you enjoyed this video  and you want to see more attack on titan  content on the channel  please slap a like to let me know it  really does help  and if you're new to anime uproar or you  just haven't subscribed make this the  video that you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications  once again thank you for over 1 million  subscribers  that is insane and you can also hit me  up on twitter and instagram  at anime uproar i want to give a big  thank you to all of our  anime uproar patrons for making videos  like this one  possible a special thank you to alpha  sigma  and liam thompson disciples of lord  twego himself  and i can't forget all of our the  one-tier patrons the ones who rise above  all other clans including ingrata  the world acquired respect pate heffa  jonathan king  rathuindeora emperor otaku thomas jones  kin mono  admirath and chris torley finally thank  you also to our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only gilgamesh  nothing but a fan  king zeldris anatoly kazatsky angel cruz  cricket xp joe stanton very gucci alicia  octor hinokamian water  bonnie parks jason wilson florian  and garcia steelers mcshamus jessica  kayla fond  deadly saint stern hawkins and  highschool dxd73  if you enjoy our videos and you feel  that they provide value to you  consider becoming a patron even a single  dollar will give you access to our  patron exclusive discord and your name  will appear in our videos  along with these amazing people as  always thank you guys so much for  watching  and until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

